        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.110.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.110.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.110.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.110.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said unto my Lord, Sit thou at my right hand, until I make thine enemies thy footstool.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.110.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.110.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 110:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.110.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.110.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.110.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.110.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shall send the rod of thy strength out of Zion: rule thou in the midst of thine enemies.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.110.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.110.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 110:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thy people",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.110.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.110.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.110.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.110.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "willing in the day of thy power, in the beauties of holiness from the womb of the morning: thou hast the dew of thy youth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.110.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.110.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 110:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.110.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.110.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.110.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.110.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath sworn, and will not repent, Thou",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.110.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.110.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "art",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.110.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.110.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a priest for ever after the order of Melchizedek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.110.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.110.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "b"
      },
      "items": []
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 110:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The Lord at thy right hand shall strike through kings in the day of his wrath.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.110.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.110.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 110:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall judge among the heathen, he shall fill",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.110.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.110.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "the places",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.110.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.110.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "with the dead bodies; he shall wound the heads over many countries.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.110.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.110.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 110:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall drink of the brook in the way: therefore shall he lift up the head.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.110.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.110.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
